<code>assert coll != null => this.size() == coll.size() && \forall int i; 0 <= i &amp;&amp; i < coll.size(); this.contains(coll.toArray()[i]);</code>

This assert statement checks that if the input collection is not null, then the size of the queue is equal to the size of the collection, and every element in the collection is contained in the queue.
